{"2218060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Backdraft","steam_appid":2218060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.avif?t=1790790388\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.webp?t=1790790388 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a pairing: choose a hero, then choose a companion. Your hero has a unique power, and your companion unlocks your second elemental card pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pairing decides what kind of run you are building. Draft around your strengths, cover your weaknesses, and discover endless combinations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/205a4385c985f759ab5e8c3ecbcc171c.poster.avif?t=1790790388\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/205a4385c985f759ab5e8c3ecbcc171c.webm?t=1790790388\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/205a4385c985f759ab5e8c3ecbcc171c.mp4?t=1790790388\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.avif?t=1790790388\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.webp?t=1790790388 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft your deck one shop visit at a time. Open packs, upgrade cards, recruit minions, and uncover artifacts. Spend wisely. The fate of your run is built one choice at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win fights to earn blessings that improve future shops, turning each victory into better choices, bigger rewards, and new ways to shape your deck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/84cac02cf34b98b2cdbb5f993e399083.poster.avif?t=1790790388\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/84cac02cf34b98b2cdbb5f993e399083.webm?t=1790790388\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/84cac02cf34b98b2cdbb5f993e399083.mp4?t=1790790388\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.avif?t=1790790388\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.webp?t=1790790388 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly difficult heroes who draft, summon, and play cards just like you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outbuild them, outplay them, and fight your way to victory!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im